{"steam_appid":1593780,"steam_name":"Organs Please","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1593780/555411/6522fb1ed2e3f894cc94b55e9ba7411d3565ab90/1750708315/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1680710336","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256939725/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1680710336","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593780/ss_1147c0816e3b216fd404f290ef99ee3130e77455.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772786933","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593780/ss_0b1160fafd3e79700210cf9eddc7506766a2856d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772786933","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593780/ss_fbc5053d76dd4a1b86977ed389a0583f45af0485.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772786933","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593780/ss_1ae9e40b9126cf1933d22ba8b044866b1662d414.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772786933","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593780/ss_fde51dcfa3c8bab8341e5244034b9088440100f6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772786933"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth’s population is on the verge of a global resource crisis. Can you build the spaceship on time and earn one more chance for humankind? Hurry, you only have only 30 days left! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Screen the visitors dying to get off the planet and more than willing to risk being turned into canned food, incinerated or hired as one of the factory’s employees. The pros and cons of each fate are debatable. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593780/extras/2500b8ca9b1943364007b1a46dd4b1fa.poster.avif?t=1772786933\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593780/extras/2500b8ca9b1943364007b1a46dd4b1fa.webm?t=1772786933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593780/extras/2500b8ca9b1943364007b1a46dd4b1fa.mp4?t=1772786933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage the factory floor, construct new facilities and upgrade the research center. Resources are finite, so try to make sure things don’t fall apart before the ship takes off. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593780/extras/67c4da8fbfaa87e1fff22a1f9623f417.poster.avif?t=1772786933\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593780/extras/67c4da8fbfaa87e1fff22a1f9623f417.webm?t=1772786933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593780/extras/67c4da8fbfaa87e1fff22a1f9623f417.mp4?t=1772786933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire staff with unique quirks, fears and prejudices. Promote hard workers and keep them pampered with improved amenities. As for the lazy ones…they get sent to a special room in the darkest corner of the factory.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593780/extras/4f8ba38af93b689854f849729e419fd2.poster.avif?t=1772786933\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593780/extras/4f8ba38af93b689854f849729e419fd2.webm?t=1772786933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593780/extras/4f8ba38af93b689854f849729e419fd2.mp4?t=1772786933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Juggle orders from competing organizations and be sure to meet your weekly quota to keep the higher-ups happy. Remember – you are alive as long as you are useful.</p></li></ul>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4590 or AMD FX 8350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 8.1 Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6700<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1070<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Indie","RPG","Simulation","Strategy"],"developers":["TECHHOME"],"publishers":["HeroCraft PC"],"release_date":"5 Apr, 2023"}